    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’ve heard of apps like Photomath or Wolfram Alpha helping students visualize problems interactively. If I were learning alone, I’d explore such tools for immediate feedback and practice—though I prefer hands-on methods like whiteboarding with friends to reinforce understanding.",
